---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy & GDPR Data Governance | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Official GDPR (Regulation EU 2016/679), EU Data Act, and sovereign data boundary privacy policy for EU DPP Provider."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">GDPR & Data Protection</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Privacy Policy & <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">Data Governance Statement</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Comprehensive disclosures regarding the processing of enterprise, telemetry, and personal data pursuant to Articles 13, 14, and 21 of the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR - Regulation EU 2016/679).
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Controller & DPO -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">1</span>
          <span>Data Controller & Data Protection Officer (DPO)</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          <p>
            The Data Controller responsible for data processing on this website and within the EU DPP Provider infrastructure is:
          </p>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/80 border border-slate-200">
            <strong class="text-slate-900">EU DPP Provider / Nanjing Ningyi Cultural Media Co., Ltd.</strong><br />
            Registered Seat: Qinhuai District, Nanjing, Jiangsu, China<br />
            EU Compliance Desk: Frankfurt am Main, Germany<br />
            Official DPO Contact: <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="text-cyan-700 font-mono font-bold">info@eudppprovider.com</a><br />
            Telephone: +49 (0) 69 9675 8827
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: Purposes & Legal Bases -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">2</span>
          <span>Categories of Data, Processing Purposes & Legal Bases</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          <div>
            <strong class="text-slate-900">A. Website Inquiries & Pilot Applications:</strong>
            <p>We process business contact data (name, email, company, telephone) to respond to technical inquiries and execute scoping pilots pursuant to Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (contract performance and pre-contractual measures).</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-slate-900">B. Battery Passport Lifecycle Records:</strong>
            <p>Processing of serialized battery data (GTIN, UPI, chemistry, carbon footprint, SOH telemetry) is conducted to fulfill statutory legal obligations under Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 (Articles 77–78) pursuant to Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-slate-900">C. Zero-Tracking Font & Technical Cookies:</strong>
            <p>We do NOT execute third-party font trackers (e.g. Google Fonts) or advertising pixels. Strictly essential session cookies are processed under Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate technical interest in site stability and multi-language routing).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Sub-processors & Cross-Border Transfers -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">3</span>
          <span>Sub-processors & International Data Transfers</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          <p>
            Our core sovereign data vaults are hosted exclusively in ISO/IEC 27001 certified data center facilities located in Frankfurt am Main and Munich, Germany.
          </p>
          <p>
            Edge CDN and DDoS protection services are provided by Cloudflare, Inc. under the European Commission's standard contractual clauses (SCCs) guaranteeing GDPR-equivalent protection.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 4: Data Retention & Subject Rights -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">4</span>
          <span>Statutory Retention Periods & Data Subject Rights</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          <p>
            <strong>10-Year Archival Mandate:</strong> Pursuant to ESPR (Regulation EU 2024/1781) Article 11 and EU Battery Regulation Article 77, electronic battery passport data is retained for a mandatory minimum period of 10 years after the final battery unit is placed on the market.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Data Subject Rights (Articles 15–22 GDPR):</strong> You have the right to request access to, rectification of, or erasure of your personal data, restriction of processing, data portability, and the right to object. Contact our DPO at <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="text-cyan-700 underline font-mono">info@eudppprovider.com</a>. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with an EU data protection supervisory authority.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
